                                        "sense_id": "8975ee01-cf59-33bf-9c4e-d57a4f415d69",
                                        "entry_id": "c953ef79-e8a1-3019-bca9-b838313ae721",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cucumis melo Cantalupensis Group, a cultivar group melon with sweet aromatic orange flesh, including two main types:",
                                            "Cantalupensis Group sensu stricto, with non- or slightly netted rind, also known as true cantaloupe or European cantaloupe, found in the Middle East and Europe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38b8c4cc-15a8-333f-b199-44f7a9316c15",
                                        "entry_id": "c953ef79-e8a1-3019-bca9-b838313ae721",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cucumis melo Cantalupensis Group, a cultivar group melon with sweet aromatic orange flesh, including two main types:",
                                            "Reticulatus Group (now merged into Cantalupensis Group), with strongly netted rind, also known as American cantaloupe, muskmelon or rockmelon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "Canada",
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5981d29b-0296-4235-8bc0-b8e4974dcfeb",
                                                "sense_id": "38b8c4cc-15a8-333f-b199-44f7a9316c15",
                                                "text": "Trevor, like an Aussie outbacker, eats snacks and a pickup meal of bread, cantaloupe, olives, mangoes, and melon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4882590-5e66-3ee6-adb4-f9765eb231dc",
                                        "entry_id": "c953ef79-e8a1-3019-bca9-b838313ae721",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An orange colour, like that of cantaloupe flesh."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1df49bb9-cd97-37f4-851b-ed852a1220e4",
                                        "entry_id": "c953ef79-e8a1-3019-bca9-b838313ae721",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A woman's breasts, particularly large breasts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural-normally",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "790d0428-ed2e-4473-8a0e-57b547ac334e",
                                                "sense_id": "1df49bb9-cd97-37f4-851b-ed852a1220e4",
                                                "text": "Distracted by the way that the sudden gust of wind exposed the girl's bare thighs, he tripped on the uneven sidewalk and faceplanted straight into her soft cantaloupes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7b257de-09c1-46cf-a070-b2e306f50946",
                                                "sense_id": "1df49bb9-cd97-37f4-851b-ed852a1220e4",
                                                "text": "\"I tell you I kept crossing my legs and lighting cigarettes, just hoping he'd notice me. But no. Instead he notices something sitting at a table. He sees a great big pair of cantaloupes sticking out from under a blouse.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17106cc2-8132-4149-9344-28fb55723a4e",
                                                "sense_id": "1df49bb9-cd97-37f4-851b-ed852a1220e4",
                                                "text": "In the water, Lenox got a little frisky and Farah ended up losing her bikini top. Lenox was glad that she was definitely blessed. The peaches and grapes walking around were no comparison to her cantaloupes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3e50c20-004b-426e-a2ae-0347e08a0c6f",
                                                "sense_id": "1df49bb9-cd97-37f4-851b-ed852a1220e4",
                                                "text": "\"Suzie that one with the pair of cantaloupes?\" Freddy holds his palms out from chest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "deb4773e-10a7-4be7-95dc-b29824440d28",
                                                "sense_id": "1df49bb9-cd97-37f4-851b-ed852a1220e4",
                                                "text": "Stepping back to avoid him, I knocked into Xander, who wrapped his arms around me. \"Me, too,\" he cooed. \"I love a good pair of cantaloupes.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
